sequenceDiagram
    actor Host
    participant Reader as Export reader
    participant Control as Control DB
    participant Execution as Execution DB
    Note over Host,Execution: New connections validate fixed credentials and optional trusted policy functions by database alias
    Host->>Host: Authenticate and authorize operation
    Host->>Reader: Collection, limits, optional cursor, caller context
    Reader->>Reader: Validate collection, budgets and cursor binding
    Reader->>Control: Short caller-scoped transaction: visible run and live routes
    Control-->>Reader: Readable placements
    Note over Reader,Control: Commit before remote reads
    loop Participating route groups, within page budget
        Reader->>Execution: One caller-scoped statement: admit key/size prefix, then fetch fitting bodies
        Execution-->>Reader: Bounded metadata and selected records from one snapshot
        Reader->>Reader: Validate encoding; commit caller context transaction
    end
    alt Successful page
        Reader-->>Host: Typed records and optional continuation
    else Authorization, route, size or database failure
        Reader-->>Host: Error; no successful partial page
    end
    Note over Host,Reader: Each subsequent page rechecks current authority and routing
